Documents under docs/references/ are historical MIT Instrumentation Laboratory,
NASA and contractor material, mirrored from the Virtual AGC document library
(ibiblio.org/apollo) and klabs.org. They are reproduced here for study; their
original terms, where any apply, are unchanged.

Core ropes under roms/ and rope-module dumps under bios/ are not committed;
tools/build_ropes.sh reconstructs them from the Virtual AGC submodule. The
original Apollo flight software is in the public domain.
